Subject: [PATCH 219/221] Aurora: a fast blur for the game's depth of field
 step 1, opt-in (RecompCore #67, as merged)

RecompCore #67 as it was merged into the 0.13.0 re-cut batch (codex/0.13.0-batch-2, d733290f), in one patch: its 2 commits.

- b0e065d5b7 Aurora: a fast blur for the game's depth of field step 1 (opt-in)
- 7558a8657d Aurora: read DOL_AURORA_GAME_DOF_FAST at first use, after the host's settings
